    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Familiar Friend Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Elemental Energy.</strong> You can infuse your familiar with elemental power. When you cast Find Familiar, choose Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder damage. Your familiar is infused with that energy until you cast Find Familiar again, which grants it the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Elemental Resistance.</strong> Your familiar has Resistance to the chosen damage type.</p><p><strong>Energy Pulse.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you command your familiar to release a burst of elemental energy; it must be within 120 feet of you and take a Reaction to do so. Each creature in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the familiar makes a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier for Find Familiar and your Proficiency Bonus). On a failure, a creature takes 2d4 damage of the chosen type and, if it is Medium or smaller, has the Prone condition.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-An7tA6S0uuCPKTWg\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use the save DC of the spellcasting ability you used for Find Familiar. Give the familiar its Resistance on its sheet; apply Prone to the Medium or smaller creatures that fail.</p></section>",
